    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58803" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κομμ-ᾰτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>consisting of short clauses</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μικρὰ καὶ κ. ἐρωτήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
				</span></i>
			<i>Bis Acc.</i><i><span class="en">
				28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδος τοῦ λόγου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermog.
					<u>Id.</u>
					1.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.1
			</span></i>. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Dem.</u>
					39
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. καὶ γοργῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					200.33
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κομματικόν</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλος</span>), τό, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κομμός</span>
			 (A), <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.53
			</span></i>.</div>
